Yeah. It comes from the swear jar

348
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:43,510
我们就投钱进去的那个脏话罐
we put money in when you curse.

349
00:15:46,470 --> 00:15:48,140
还有什么事是我不知道的
What else don't I know about?

350
00:15:48,140 --> 00:15:51,610
-你的私人卫生间  -怎么了
- Uh, well, you know your private bathroom? - Yeah?

351
00:15:51,610 --> 00:15:53,880
那应该是给整层楼的人使用的
That was supposed to be for the whole floor.

352
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:56,000
-你开什么玩笑  -那个无所谓
- You're kidding. - No, no. It's okay.

353
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,120
其实只对轮椅妹凯西有影响
It only really affected wheelchair Kathy,

354
00:15:58,120 --> 00:16:00,560
现在她已经回医院了
and she's back in the hospital now,

355
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,160
所以没什么问题了
so it all worked out.

356
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:05,280
我感觉好难过哦
I feel so bad.

357
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:08,410
那你就不应该给人家取名"轮椅妹凯西"啊
Well, then, maybe you shouldn't have named her "Wheelchair Kathy."

358
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,720
我的天啊
Oh, my God!

359
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,960
我以为大家都喜欢我  其实我只是个怪兽
I thought everybody liked me, but I'm just a monster.

360
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:18,910
但很可爱呀  就像《怪兽公司》里的独眼怪
But a cute one, like that, uh, eyeball guy in Monsters, Inc.

361
00:16:19,830 --> 00:16:21,580
不  我最坏了
No, I'm the worst.

362
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:23,410
我是个坏人
I'm a terrible person.

363
00:16:23,410 --> 00:16:25,880
乖  别哭  没关系啦
Come on, don't cry. It's okay.

364
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:27,110
有关系
It's not okay.

365
00:16:27,110 --> 00:16:29,780
我哪还有脸留在这工作呀
How can I even work here anymore? Oh.

366
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,420
-这家公司需要你  -真没事
- Because this company needs you. - It's fine.

367
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:33,150
我们不介意给你买咖啡
We don't mind paying for the coffee.

368
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:35,550
我不能让你们这么做
I can't let you do that.

369
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,190
或许我们可以给你
Maybe we could get you

370
00:16:37,190 --> 00:16:39,670
买一台咖啡机放在你办公室里
an espresso machine for your office.

371
00:16:39,950 --> 00:16:43,390
-这样也行吧  -好的
- I guess that would be all right. - All right.

372
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:47,620
瞧  你不刻薄也能得到你想要的东西
See? You don't have to be mean to get what you want.

373
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:49,310
此话有理
You're right.

374
00:16:49,310 --> 00:16:52,740
那我的私人卫生间现在怎么处理呢
Now where did we land on my bathroom?

375
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:58,390
好啊
Hi.

376
00:16:58,650 --> 00:16:59,520
回来啦
Hello.

377
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:01,210
这么晚还不睡吗
How come you're up so late?

378
00:17:01,210 --> 00:17:04,610
我上传《有趣的旗帜》最终集好几个小时了
I posted the last episode of Fun with Flags hours ago,

379
00:17:04,610 --> 00:17:08,140
没有任何人在乎到愿意留个言
and not a single person cared enough to comment.

380
00:17:09,570 --> 00:17:11,550
一切努力都是徒然
All that effort for nothing.

381
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:14,130
我明白你的感受
I know how you feel.

382
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:16,360
我今天一天把一个男人一生事业扔进垃圾桶
I spent the day throwing out a man's entire career,

383
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:18,300
唯一留下的是一瓶陈年香槟
and all that's left is an old bottle of champagne

384
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:20,660
和拉杰自以为没人发现
and a naked lady pen that Raj took

385
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:22,690
就私吞了的一根裸女笔
when he thought no one was looking.

386
00:17:24,870 --> 00:17:26,620
这根本是两码事
It's not the same thing.

387
00:17:26,620 --> 00:17:29,040
你完全不明白我的感受
I don't think you know how I feel at all.

388
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:31,070
是难过吗
Sad?

389
00:17:32,970 --> 00:17:34,900
看来你真的懂我
You do get me.

390
00:17:37,970 --> 00:17:39,340
有人留言了
Someone left a comment.

391
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:40,620
他们说什么
Yeah. What did they say?

392
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:42,580
"你的节目结束了真可惜
"Too bad your show is done.

393
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:44,190
我还挺喜欢的"
I kind of liked it."

394
00:17:44,190 --> 00:17:47,140
莱纳德  你听到了吗
Leonard, did you hear that?

395
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:50,870
网友们难过得要死
Oh, the people are heartbroken!

396
00:17:51,790 --> 00:17:54,720
这世界上不能没有这节目
I can't take this away from the world!

397
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:57,550
《有趣的旗帜》满血复活了
Fun with Flags is back!

398
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:00,010
恭喜
Congratulations.

399
00:18:00,010 --> 00:18:01,740
我们来庆祝吧
Let's celebrate!

400
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:07,040
谢尔顿  那不是给你的
Sheldon, that wasn't for you!

401
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,550
我也没打算喝啊
Oh, no, I'm not going to drink it.

402
00:18:08,550 --> 00:18:10,890
我只想听开瓶那砰的一声
I just wanted to hear the pop.

403
00:18:11,860 --> 00:18:14,600
我知道会砰的一声  还是吓死人家了
Yeah, I knew it was coming. Still scary.

404
00:18:22,510 --> 00:18:23,640
莱瓦尔·伯顿
LeVar Burton?

405
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,370
莱瓦尔·伯顿
LeVar Burton!

406
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,310
莱瓦尔·伯顿
LeVar Burton!

407
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,230
你来干嘛
What are you doing here?

408
00:18:31,230 --> 00:18:33,040
你不让我打电话给你
You told me not to call,

409
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:35,220
我不知道该怎么告诉你这个好消息
and I didn't know how else to give you the good news.

410
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:36,790
《有趣的旗帜》回归了
Fun with Flags is back,

411
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:38,790
下一集你可以来当嘉宾
and you can be in the next episode.

412
00:18:38,790 --> 00:18:40,110
威尔·惠顿让我弄个大闸门
Wil Wheaton said, get a gate.

413
00:18:40,110 --> 00:18:42,000
-我当初真该听他的话  -你真是...
- I don't know why I didn't get a gate. - You...

414
00:18:43,530 --> 00:18:45,270
至少你听我说完前提
At least listen to the premise.

415
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:47,240
既然你在德国出生
Since you were born in Germany,

416
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:50,020
我们可以聊聊德国国旗
I thought we could talk about German flags.

417
00:18:50,410 --> 00:18:54,520
你有兴趣装扮成卐字图案吗
How do you feel about dressing up like a swastika?

418
00:18:50,410 --> 00:18:54,520
德国纳粹旗  该卐与佛教的卍相反

